  "notes": "## Changes since `v0.4.2-beta.4`\n\n### Features\n\n- implement WebDAV sync functionality ([40b05e63](https://github.com/330079598/tTerm/commit/40b05e63a9beb52a14424e2b87dac9ec5656bed3))\n- add WebDAV backup functionality and settings management ([45c16021](https://github.com/330079598/tTerm/commit/45c160217b122fed75377e5fa995b22b75bab910))\n- add running tunnel count display in title bar and related localization ([37149c6d](https://github.com/330079598/tTerm/commit/37149c6d20af2a8f468551c3304a014ed435d766))\n\n### Other changes\n\n- upgrade @tauri-apps dependencies to latest versions ([052e6c28](https://github.com/330079598/tTerm/commit/052e6c28c898dc4ae0ac8e586fa339f3a1f2c5f7))\n- upgrade keyring to 4 ([cf524367](https://github.com/330079598/tTerm/commit/cf5243677657a953fdb1fcf845c91d00c9d42b58))\n- upgrade russh 0.63, russh-sftp 3, rand 0.10 and RustCrypto crates ([34cce3f2](https://github.com/330079598/tTerm/commit/34cce3f24a8056b9bb9004c1f86b48febae2fb09))\n- upgrade rusqlite, reqwest, zip, quick-xml, vte, base64, ttf-parser, windows ([10fb2fec](https://github.com/330079598/tTerm/commit/10fb2fec9a2f035d30a7909bc556ba01cb1b6eef))\n- upgrade semver-compatible Rust dependencies ([c5586a78](https://github.com/330079598/tTerm/commit/c5586a786873e5dc19f54998f719f0eb6855327f))\n\n**Full comparison:** [v0.4.2-beta.4...v0.4.2-beta.5](https://github.com/330079598/tTerm/compare/v0.4.2-beta.4...v0.4.2-beta.5)\n",
